        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a variety of weapons, skills, and characters to fend off the ever growing waves of enemies. The choices you make will heavily influence the tide of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/f5fb2e872dba150f17e70fe3d6403d2d.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1272 height=712 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has their own unique attacks and behaviors, creating different challenges after each stage. Be sure to look for weaknesses and patterns in the enemies you face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/08c026ab3825f4747037addb4d396e2f.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1282 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will work together to take you down; some will focused on supporting allies while others will charge you head on. Watch out for the glowing elite creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/983060919784e1bd559168cfb4e42a9d.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgrades after each run to become strong enough to take on the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/8db92fa05e7bd1379e65539c951fe0d3.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a variety of weapons, skills, and characters to fend off the ever growing waves of enemies. The choices you make will heavily influence the tide of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/f5fb2e872dba150f17e70fe3d6403d2d.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1272 height=712 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has their own unique attacks and behaviors, creating different challenges after each stage. Be sure to look for weaknesses and patterns in the enemies you face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/08c026ab3825f4747037addb4d396e2f.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1282 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will work together to take you down; some will focused on supporting allies while others will charge you head on. Watch out for the glowing elite creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/983060919784e1bd559168cfb4e42a9d.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgrades after each run to become strong enough to take on the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109720/extras/8db92fa05e7bd1379e65539c951fe0d3.avif?t=1762629763\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
